{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find and grab object. If found, grab and move to storage. If visible, move and take.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachToObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObjectStorage    /> <Action ID = ReleaseObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = ExploreArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />",
